        "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
        "explanation": "The doctor fails to recognize that benign tumor with obstructive hydrocephalus requires prompt neurosurgical evaluation, instead treating it as a routine outpatient problem.",
        "quote": "脑积水、还有头疼，按国内神经外科的常规判断，\"限期\"的可能性更大"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
